        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "23 Deerpark, Ballinasloe, Co. Galway, H53 K292\r\n\r\nKevin O’Flynn Estate Agents brings No. 23 Deerpark to the market—a 3-bedroom terraced home located in the Deerpark area of Ballinasloe.\r\n\r\nThe property extends to approximately 1,000 sq. ft. and has been fully renovated by the current owner. It is presented in move-in condition.\r\n\r\nNote for buyers: This property may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant of up to €50,000, subject to the applicant and property meeting the relevant local authority criteria.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway: Leads directly to the main living areas.\r\nLiving Room: Front sitting room fitted with a solid fuel insert stove.\r\nKitchen / Dining Room: Located off the living room, fully tiled with space for cooking and dining.\r\nBedrooms: Three bedrooms located on the first floor.\r\nFamily Bathroom: Fitted with both a bath and a separate shower.\r\nExterior & Access The rear door leads to a private courtyard with an outdoor storage shed. Rear access is provided via an established right of way.\r\n\r\nHeating Oil-fired central heating, supplemented by the solid fuel insert stove in the living room.\r\n\r\nLocation \r\n\r\nIdeal location for commuters, offering convenient access to local transport links:\r\n\r\nBallinasloe Train Station: 1.8 km\r\nM6 Motorway: Direct access nearby for connections to Galway, Athlone, and Dublin\r\nBallinasloe Town Centre: 2 km\r\nClose to local amenities, schools, and Portiuncula University Hospital\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n3 Bedrooms | 1 Bathroom\r\nTerraced house extending to approx. 1,000 sq. ft.\r\nFully renovated interior\r\nConvenient location near the train station and M6 Motorway\r\nMay qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant (up to €50,000, subject to requirements)\r\nOil central heating & solid fuel insert stove\r\nFully tiled kitchen\r\nPrivate rear courtyard with shed\r\nRear right-of-way access\r\n\r\nBER No: 107646457\r\nViewings For further details or to arrange a viewing, please contact Kevin O’Flynn Estate Agents."
      },
